@startuml
title Develop Lane
left to right direction
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #1d4f73
skinparam Rectangle {
  BorderColor #1d4f73
  BackgroundColor #eef6fb
  FontColor #0f172a
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam Note {
  BorderColor #8b6f2f
  BackgroundColor #fff7d6
  FontColor #3f3420
}

rectangle "Push or merge to develop" as trigger
rectangle "Verify\nformat-and-vet" as verify
rectangle "Test\nunit-tests\nkubectl-splunk-tests\noss-scan (advisory)" as test
rectangle "Build\nbuild-stage-image" as build
rectangle "Image scan\nscan-stage-image-container" as scan
rectangle "Smoke fanout on disposable EKS\nall smoke suites in parallel" as smoke #eefbf1
rectangle "Merged-branch evidence\nci-output and test reports" as evidence #f7f7ff

trigger --> verify
verify --> test
test --> build
build --> scan
scan --> smoke
smoke --> evidence

note bottom of build
The develop lane reuses the same staged-image contract
as the MR lane and validates the merged branch tip.
end note
@enduml
